ts.\n\n---\n\n#### Conclusion  \n\nInequality (14) shows that no tiling can use fewer than \\(2n-2\\) tiles, while the construction above shows that \\(2n-2\\) tiles are sufficient. Therefore the minimum possible number of tiles is  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\cdot2025-2=4048}.\n\\]"
